ml","released":"2026-04-30"},"politics":{"publisher":"BPS, using KPU / Dewan Pers data","title":"Statistik Politik 2025, Volume 15","url":"https://www.bps.go.id/id/publication/2025/12/22/8bc8ad59afe1985f822fce41/statistik-politik-2025.html","released":"2025-12-22"}},"caveats":["2024 PDRB figures marked revised (*) and 2025 figures preliminary (**), as in BPS publication.","New Papua provinces have no comparable 2021–22 province time series: missing values remain null.","PMTB is a national-account investment component, not BKPM realized PMA/PMDN; GRDP at current vs constant prices have different uses.","Provincial expenditure GRDP aggregates in the publication need not reconcile exactly to a separate national GDP line; do not mechanically force equality.","The press-freedom series reflects Dewan Pers data as reproduced by BPS. It is neither an SLI political ranking nor a prediction.","DPT is registered voters, not voter turnout. DI Yogyakarta shows no provincial governor election in the 2024 table; national totals should not be recomputed from non-comparable province rows.","IDI national and press freedom indices are distinct constructs. Do not combine them into a political risk score."],"licensing_note":"BPS publication includes written-permission conditions for commercial reproduction. Verify permission before republishing extensive tables commercially; only targeted factual indicators are selected and attributed."}